{
  "uid": "infra-overview",
  "title": "基础设施 · 观测覆盖与定位入口",
  "id": null,
  "version": 3,
  "schemaVersion": 42,
  "editable": true,
  "description": "",
  "tags": [
    "infrastructure",
    "alerting",
    "evidence"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "观测覆盖 · 有指标不等于服务健康",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "label_replace(label_replace((count(k8s_container_ready) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"Kubernetes 对象状态\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-kubernetes\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(cnpg_collector_up) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"CNPG / 备份时间\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-cnpg\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(kafka_connect_connector_task_status) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"Kafka / Connect\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-cdc\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(otelcol_exporter_queue_size) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"OTel 导出队列\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-observability\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(hubble_flows_processed_total) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"Hubble 网络事件\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-observability\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(gatus_results_endpoint_success) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"Gatus 合成探测\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-observability\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(alert_bridge_notifications_total) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"通知 bridge\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"ntfy-alerting-overview\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(label_replace((count(node_cpu_seconds_total) > bool 0) or vector(0), \"capability\", \"宿主 CPU exporter\", \"\", \"\"), \"dashboard_uid\", \"infra-kubernetes\", \"\", \"\")",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "filterable": true,
            "wrapText": true,
            "wrapHeaderText": true,
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "当前数据"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "未接入 / 无数据",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "有指标",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "观测能力"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "打开证据面板",
                    "url": "/d/${__data.fields[\"入口\"]}?${__url_time_range}",
                    "targetBlank": false
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "入口"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "md",
        "enablePagination": true
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "includeByName": {
              "capability": true,
              "Value": true,
              "dashboard_uid": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "capability": "观测能力",
              "Value": "当前数据",
              "dashboard_uid": "入口"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "capability": 0,
              "Value": 1,
              "dashboard_uid": 2
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "基础设施定位路径",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**数据库 / 备份**：可用备份时间、恢复点、WAL、连接与复制。\n\n**Kubernetes**：节点 Ready、Deployment/StatefulSet、运行容器与重启。\n\n**Kafka / CDC**：task、源库连接、复制槽、lag 和对账。\n\n**采集 / 网络**：OTel 队列、Hubble 丢弃、Gatus 与通知链。\n\n当前告警的「查看证据」会携带对象筛选；每页顶部可返回问题工作台。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "仍需补齐的观测，不以空白冒充健康",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "- node0/node1/node2 宿主资源与 watchdog 状态尚无本套 Prometheus 证据；不能把 Kubernetes 节点状态当成全部宿主。\n- 容器实际 CPU/内存、磁盘容量需要对应采集器，requests/limits 不等于实际用量。\n- CNPG Backup / ScheduledBackup 对象状态和恢复演练尚未在本面板自动取证；备份时间为 0 能证明缺少可用备份记录，不能单独区分配置缺失与任务失败。\n- Silo、Redis、Elasticsearch 等应用专属指标未逐一接入；目前只能查其 Kubernetes 对象和已配置的 Gatus 探测。\n- 外部独立 dead-man 与手机送达仍需独立验证。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "指标数据源",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "regex": "/VictoriaMetrics/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "options": [],
        "current": {
          "text": "VictoriaMetrics",
          "value": "VictoriaMetrics"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
